# Repository layout

- Implement product code only under `project/` (services, shared, web_client, apps, infra, tests, uv workspace).
- Repo root keeps `context/`, `README.md`, `.cursor/`, `.gitignore`, and similar files for working with the agent.
- Do not add application packages or `pyproject.toml` at the repository root.
